    title: "Iran says it is not concerned about US naval blockade: Report",
    summary: "Iran says it is not concerned about US naval blockade: Report Iran's First Vice President Mohammad Reza Aref said that Tehran is not concerned about the US naval blockade, the semi-official Tasnim news agency reported. He indicated the country's self-reliance with the increase of cargo clearance through its non-southern borders and added that reserves of strategic goods remain strong.",
